  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Hills and Valleys**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [6]\n- **Bringing in that Georgia Mail**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **Southbound**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 8 archived performances [6]\n- **Used to Be**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: This Heart of Mine [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **BillyStrings2016-10-16.sbd.matrix.cafiero.flac16** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 8 songs; 45 min [1]\n- **billystrings2016-10-16.schoeps.sbd.flac16**: matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 8 songs; 45 min [2]\n- **billystrings2016-10-16.litzenberger.soundboard.schoepsMK41v.flac24**: matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 8 songs; 45 min [3]\n- **BillyStrings2016-10-16.RodeM5.flac16**: source not stated; 6 songs; 39 min [4]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Billy Strings opened for Yonder Mountain String Band; a full-set 4K video is linked on YouTube [1]\n- JP Biondo of Cabinet appeared as special guest; Billy Strings opened for Yonder Mountain String Band [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **BillyStrings2016-10-16.sbd.matrix.cafiero.flac16**: taped by Chris Cafiero; transferred by Rich Stoler; source: SBD > FOH Board > Tascam DR-100(24bit/44.1) [1]. Also: Reviewer says this is a pure soundboard, not a matrix; the Audix mics were removed from the mix; Reviewer mixed the clean soundboard with their own Schoeps mics in post production; no separate mix was made for Cafiero; Chain: soundboard via front-of-house board to Tascam DR-100 at 24-bit/44.1, then Audacity with dither to 16-bit, CD Wave, FLAC [1][5]\n- **billystrings2016-10-16.schoeps.sbd.flac16**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: Soundboard+Schoeps MK41v's>KCY250/05i>VST62iu>SD744t [2]. Also: Soundboard blended with Schoeps MK41V mics placed 20 feet from stage, recorded on Sound Devices 744t at 24-bit/48kHz; Mixed in Nuendo 4, converted to 16-bit/44.1kHz in Sound Forge Pro 11 with iZotope MBIT+, tracked in CD Wave, FLAC via Trader's Little Helper [2]\n- **billystrings2016-10-16.litzenberger.soundboard.schoepsMK41v.flac24**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: Soundboard + Schoeps MK41V's(20 ft from stage)>Schoeps KCY >250/5i>SchoepVST62iu>Devices 744t (24 Bit/48khz) [3]. Also: Mixed in Nuendo 4, faded in Sound Forge Pro 11, tracked in CD Wave, FLAC encoded, tagged with Foobar2000; 24-bit release [3]\n- **BillyStrings2016-10-16.RodeM5.flac16**: taped by Rich Stoler; transferred by Rich Stoler; source: Rode M5 Mics -> Rolls Mic Power IIb -> TASCAM DR-100MKII @ 16-Bit/44.1 [4]",
